    "detailed_description": "A 3D remake of the ageless classic puzzle game. Familiar Tetris gameplay with new features. Move, rotate blocks, clear lines!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic Mode</h2><br>Play by your own rules set new records.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Campaign Mode</h2><br>Go through all stages, from a simple walk to a real challenge to your reaction and logic.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Set to Your Liking</h2><br>Change the block type from ordinary tetromino blocks to complex 3D monsters. Adjust pit depth from 6 to 12 lines.<br><br>Choose an interface style from classic to cyberpunk! Enjoy the gameplay with pleasant music in up to 4k resolution.<br><br>Let nothing distract from the game and new records !!!",
